AaveV3Liquidity.liquidityWithBorrow
├── when the reserve is inactive or paused
│   └── it returns zero before reading unused reserve or valuation data
├── when no supplied balance or reserve cash is available
│   └── it skips account and price queries
├── when no reserve is borrowed
│   ├── it uses only the borrowing bitmap to detect zero debt
│   ├── it supports all collateral bits without treating them as debt
│   └── it matches the original supply and cash bound
├── when debt exists
│   ├── it preserves health, isolation, siloed and collateral-use restrictions
│   ├── it checks restrictions on other configured reserves
│   ├── it postpones price and rounding reads until collateral sizing needs them
│   ├── it retains required-query failures and decimal bounds
│   └── it matches the original rounding calculation under differential fuzzing
└── on the pinned Ethereum pool
    ├── it returns the original capacity for supply-only and debt-backed WETH
    ├── it withdraws that capacity and preserves solvency
    └── it measures isolated gas against the original helper
